      "stepNumber": 1,
      "title": "Take Absolute Value of Terms",
      "mathExpression": "\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\left| \\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^2} \\right| = \\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{1}{n^2}",
      "explanation": "Form absolute series.",
